          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有入門房間永久免費"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every decision you train here is one you'll make faster at the table.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hver beslutning, du træner her, tager du hurtigere ved bordet."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Entscheidung, die du hier trainierst, triffst du am Tisch schneller."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Κάθε απόφαση που εξασκείτε εδώ θα την παίρνετε πιο γρήγορα στο τραπέζι."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque décision travaillée ici, vous la prendrez plus vite à table."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni decisione che alleni qui la prenderai più in fretta al tavolo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここで練習した判断は、テーブルでもっと速くできるようになります。"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elke beslissing die je hier traint, neem je aan tafel sneller."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ทุกการตัดสินใจที่ฝึกที่นี่ คุณจะทำได้เร็วขึ้นที่โต๊ะ"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Burada çalıştığınız her kararı masada daha hızlı vereceksiniz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這裡練的每個決定，上牌桌時都會更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every hand here is dealt fresh the moment you see it, so you can practise for as long as you like without repeating a question.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hver hånd her gives i det øjeblik, du ser den, så du kan øve, så længe du vil, uden at et spørgsmål gentages."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Hand hier wird in dem Moment gegeben, in dem du sie siehst. So übst du, so lange du willst, ohne eine Frage zu wiederholen."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Κάθε χέρι εδώ μοιράζεται τη στιγμή που το βλέπετε, οπότε εξασκείστε όσο θέλετε χωρίς να επαναληφθεί ερώτηση."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque main est distribuée au moment où vous la voyez : entraînez-vous aussi longtemps que vous voulez sans jamais revoir la même question."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni mano qui viene distribuita nel momento in cui la vedi, così puoi allenarti quanto vuoi senza mai ripetere una domanda."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここでは見た瞬間に手が配られるので、同じ問題を繰り返すことなく好きなだけ練習できます。"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elke hand hier wordt gedeeld op het moment dat je hem ziet, dus je kunt zo lang oefenen als je wilt zonder een vraag te herhalen."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ทุกมือที่นี่แจกขึ้นตอนที่คุณเห็น จึงฝึกได้นานเท่าที่ต้องการโดยไม่มีคำถามซ้ำ"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buradaki her el siz gördüğünüz anda dağıtılır, böylece hiçbir soru tekrar etmeden istediğiniz kadar çalışabilirsiniz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這裡的每手牌都在你看到的那一刻才發出，想練多久就練多久，題目不會重複。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything you have stays free. %@ adds practice that never runs out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alt, hvad du har, forbliver gratis. %@ giver træning, der aldrig slipper op."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles, was du hast, bleibt kostenlos. %@ bringt Übung, die nie ausgeht."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
