        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這手牌 14 點、五張紅心，低於 15 到 17 點的無王範圍。開叫五張高花 1♥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This hand has 14 HCP and five spades. That is below the 15 to 17 notrump range, so open the five-card major, 1♠.": {
